sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 👤 User
    participant W as 🌐 booking widget (JS)
    participant A as ⚙️ availability.php
    participant E as ⚙️ ezee.php (ezee_get)
    participant Z as ☁️ eZee YCS API<br/>live.ipms247.com

    U->>W: Select check-in/out, guests
    W->>A: GET /api/availability.php?check_in=...&check_out=...&adults=1&rooms=1
    A->>E: ezee_get("RoomList", params)
    E->>Z: GET /booking/reservation_api/listing.php<br/>?request_type=RoomList<br/>&HotelCode=57677<br/>&APIKey=5137190432e4acb9a0-9306-11f1-8<br/>&check_in_date=2026-08-13<br/>&check_out_date=2026-08-14<br/>&number_adults=1<br/>&number_children=0<br/>&num_rooms=1<br/>&show_only_available_rooms=1<br/>&showtax=1

    Note over Z: eZee back office check:<br/>rooms/rates published?<br/>BE-API Lite active?

    Z-->>E: 200 OK<br/>{"0":{"Error Details":<br/>{"Error_Code":-1,<br/>"Error_Message":<br/>"No Data found."}},<br/>"_ok":true}
    E-->>A: decoded array (no room options)
    A-->>W: 200 { rooms: [] } or mapped error
    W-->>U: ❌ "No rooms available"
